    "## Patch train.py\n",
    "\n",
    "Only one fix needed for a from-scratch run: the final-save block was\n",
    "silently dropping optimizer/scheduler state, which means a from-scratch\n",
    "run couldn't be resumed later if interrupted. (The `--init_from` /\n",
    "warm-start patches from the previous notebook aren't needed here since\n",
    "we're not loading any checkpoint.)\n",
    "\n",
    "Idempotent -- safe to re-run this cell multiple times in the same session.\n"
   ]
  },
